## Original Content
Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi said on Saturday that stronger friendship and cooperation between China and Indonesia have not only promoted their respective development but also set an example of mutually beneficial cooperation among Global South countries.

## Summary
Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi highlighted that stronger ties between China and Indonesia have boosted their development and serve as a model for cooperation among Global South nations.

## Key Points
- China and Indonesia have strengthened their friendship and cooperation.
- This cooperation has promoted the development of both countries.
- The partnership is setting an example for mutually beneficial cooperation among Global South countries.


